# The CLI's offline replay store (feasible/extract/fixtures/*.json) is COMMITTED and
# LOAD-BEARING (read by `feasible extract` on a fresh clone) — do NOT ignore it.
# These test fixtures, by contrast, are SELF-SEEDED at runtime: every consuming test
# (tests/extract/test_orchestrate.py) writes the full run via `_write_full_run` before
# reading it. The committed copies were dead weight and drifted vs the CLI store, so
# they are untracked here (the .gitkeep keeps the dir).
/tests/extract/fixtures/*.json
